              "size": "3_5",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Perfect for families</h2> <p>Swift is the perfect sociable cottage, with a large lounge including a reading corner and french doors out onto a private patio this cottage is perfect for families and friends. Swift offers colourful open plan living with a fully equipped kitchen and large dining table. The spacious master bedroom with ensuite one end and the twin rooms and family bathroom the other flank the main living area. </p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": "2_5",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h4 data-font=\"sans\">Features</h4> <ul> <li>Kitchen dining room</li> <li>Large sitting room</li> <li>Master Bedroom kingsize bed,</li> <li>with en-suite shower over bath</li> <li>Bed 2 – twin beds</li> <li>Bed 3 – twin beds,</li> <li>with full size pull out single bed</li> <li>Family bathroom with corner bath &amp; shower over</li> <li>Patio area</li> <li>Pets accepted</li> </ul>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
